# Implementation Plan - Expense Management Module Enhancements

Develop the backend and frontend features for the Expense Management Module to satisfy all specifications and KPIs of Module 3 in [KPI_enterprise_expense_management.md](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/agents/KPI_enterprise_expense_management.md) (labeled as Module 2 in the user request).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Idempotency Headers (`EXP-09`)**: We will support the standard `Idempotency-Key` header on the expense submission API. If a client retries a submission with an existing key, the backend returns the original created record without creating a duplicate.
> - **Receipt-Less Limit (`EXP-07`)**: Expenses up to $25 are allowed without receipts. Any expense above $25 without a receipt will reject with a `422 Unprocessable Entity` status.
> - **Cost Center Specific Policies (`EXP-03`)**: Implement the Marketing breakfast/coffee limit ($15.00) in the backend policy engine for category `meals` and cost center `CC-102`/`MKT-400`.
> - **Pagination (`EXP-10`)**: Implement proper page slicing in `GET /api/v1/expenses` supporting `page` and `limit` parameters.

